  "notes": "A book for «الكتاب» (after Musa's name), geometric for «ولولا كلمة سبقت من ربك» and «ليوفينهم ربك أعمالهم». 112 addresses the Prophet ﷺ: no plate. 113: no fire drawn; As-Sa'di's definition of «الركون» (inclining to the wrongdoer in his wrong) keeps the warning precise. 110:14-18 is not glossed (the tafsirs differ on who doubts and what). As-Sa'di's «يقضي بينهم يوم القيامة» (10:93 wording) is cut."
